cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the archived deposit below."
title: "Hakatai cyclostratigraphy: ZB23.N64 cycle-duration analysis"
abstract: >-
  Julia code that downloads the ZB23.N64 astronomical solutions, builds a
  weighted ETP signal, bandpass-filters it at the Milankovitch target
  frequencies, detects peaks, and reports mean cycle durations per 1 Myr
  block with 95% intervals. Accompanies the Middle Hakatai Shale
  cyclostratigraphy manuscript.
type: software
